To add an icon: copy its NAME-symbolic.svg here from the same tag, list
it above, and add NAME to user/lib/ui/icons.l0's ui_icon_names. A
full-color one, as Files and Disks show things: copy its NAME.svg into
scalable/, list it above, and add NAME to ui_image_names.
